        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>一张图搞定HMO</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background-color: #4a9fd8;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 8px);\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    width: 480px;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    padding: 25px 25px 35px 25px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .title-banner {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #f7941d;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 12px 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .dots {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    top: -10px;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #333;\n    box-shadow: 0 -14px 0 #333;\n  }\n\n  .cow-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n    right: 15px;\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 60px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #f0f0f0, #f0f0f0 4px, #ddd 4px, #ddd 8px);\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .intro-box {\n    background: #cfe9f5;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .intro-box b {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    color: #f0603a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    border: 2px solid #f7941d;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .section-header {\n    background: #f7941d;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: 0 0 14px 0;\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .section-header sup {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .section-body {\n    padding: 14px 18px 18px 18px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .footnote-ref {\n    color: #f0603a;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    vertical-align: super;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n\n  <div class=\"dots\"></div>\n  <div class=\"title-banner\">一张图搞定HMO</div>\n\n  <div class=\"cow-placeholder\">[Illustration: cow head, top-right]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-box\">\n    HMO-中文“母乳低聚糖”，是源乳中的第一大免疫<br>\n    活性营养，而且含量还是乳铁蛋白的10倍<sup class=\"footnote-ref\">7</sup>，在牛乳、<br>\n    羊乳中都没有这个成分，被誉为“乳黄金”。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">HMO具有调节肠道菌群平衡作用<sup>3-6</sup></div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      肠道是人体第一大免疫器官，宝宝70%的免疫细胞来自<br>\n      于肠道，因此呵护好宝宝肠道对提升保护力非常重要。<br>\n      而HMO可以促进有益菌生长，提高保护力。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">HMO为宝宝建立一道健康防护屏障<sup>5-6</sup></div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      HMO能够为宝宝建立一道健康防护屏障，<br>\n      防止有害菌侵扰。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">HMO激发免疫系统，提高宝宝保护力<sup>6</sup></div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      HMO能够双倍激发宝宝体内的活性抗体，大大提高宝宝<br>\n      保护力，增强宝宝体质。<sup>7-8</sup>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
